@startuml
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

box "Afsenderside (GLN: 5790009999999)" #F4F8FB
    actor "Afsender EUA\n(Taler kun OIOXML)" as Sender
    participant "Afsender Mapning" as SenderMap
    participant "Afsender AP / VANS\n(Afsender-gateway)" as SenderGW
end box

participant "EER\n(FHIR Endpoint Register)" as EER

box "Modtagerside (GLN: 5790001234567)" #F9F5FA
    participant "Modtager AP / VANS\n(Modtager-gateway)" as ReceiverGW
    participant "Modtager Mapning" as ReceiverMap
    actor "Modtager EUA\n(Taler kun EDIFACT)" as Receiver
end box

== 1. Afsenderside: Opslag på offentligt udvekslingsformat ==
Sender -> SenderGW : Afleverer besked i internt format (OIOXML)
activate SenderGW
SenderGW -> EER : GET /Endpoint?identifier=gs1.org/gln|5790001234567
activate EER
EER --> SenderGW : Public Endpoint\n(Udvekslingsformat er FHIR via EHMI)
deactivate EER

== 2. Afsenderside: Mapning til aftalt udvekslingsformat ==
SenderGW -> SenderMap : Konverter OIOXML -> FHIR (aftalt standard)
activate SenderMap
SenderMap --> SenderGW : Returnerer FHIR-meddelelse
deactivate SenderMap

SenderGW -> ReceiverGW : Transporterer FHIR-meddelelse over EHMI
deactivate SenderGW
activate ReceiverGW

== 3. Modtagerside: Opslag på reel EUA-kapabilitet ==
ReceiverGW -> EER : GET /Endpoint?identifier=eua-gln|5790001234567
activate EER
EER --> ReceiverGW : EUA Target Endpoint\n(Modtager EUA kræver EDIFACT)
deactivate EER

== 4. Modtagerside: Mapning til modtager EUA's format ==
ReceiverGW -> ReceiverMap : Konverter FHIR -> EDIFACT
deactivate ReceiverGW
activate ReceiverMap
ReceiverMap -> Receiver : Afleverer EDIFACT i lokal postkasse
deactivate ReceiverMap
activate Receiver

== 5. Kvitteringsflow: Dobbelt mapning tilbage ==
Receiver --> ReceiverMap : Returnerer EDIFACT kvittering
deactivate Receiver
activate ReceiverMap
ReceiverMap -> ReceiverGW : Konverter EDIFACT kvittering -> FHIR Ack
deactivate ReceiverMap
activate ReceiverGW

ReceiverGW --> SenderGW : Transporterer FHIR Ack over EHMI
deactivate ReceiverGW
activate SenderGW

SenderGW -> SenderMap : Konverter FHIR Ack -> OIOXML CTL
activate SenderMap
SenderMap --> SenderGW : Returnerer OIOXML CTL
deactivate SenderMap

SenderGW --> Sender : Afleverer OIOXML CTL til Afsender EUA
deactivate SenderGW

@enduml
